#. type: Title #
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:1 docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:5
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "No fridge magnets."
msgid "Fridge Magnet"
msgstr "当前无冰箱贴便签。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:8
msgid ""
"Cross-turn sticky notes for digital-life working memory. Content lives in "
"Redis with TTL; at inference time it **manifests** in the conversation "
"stream — not in the persisted system prompt."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:9
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Three Stages"
msgid "Three layers"
msgstr "三阶段"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:16
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Round | Intent                                   |\n"
#| "| ----- | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| 1     | Contradiction detection + expiry marking |\n"
#| "| 2     | Split multi-fact entries                 |\n"
#| "| 3     | Dedup merge similar entries              |\n"
#| "| 4     | Pin maintenance (keep pinned ≤ 20)       |\n"
msgid ""
"| Layer         | Role                                                 | Persistence                   |\n"
"| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| Write         | `fridge_magnet_write`, tasks bridge, dream reminders | —                             |\n"
"| Storage       | Redis `fridge-magnet:*` keys                         | Redis (TTL)                   |\n"
"| Consciousness | Runtime message before each LLM call                 | **Not stored** in PG messages |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 轮次 | 意图                                   |\n"
"| ----- | ---------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 1     | 矛盾检测 + 过期标记 |\n"
"| 2     | 拆分多事实条目                 |\n"
"| 3     | 去重合并相似条目              |\n"
"| 4     | 置顶质量审查（解除过时置顶；常驻读仍上限 40 条）       |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consciousness representation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:20
msgid ""
"When the board has at least one non-empty entry **and** the last message in "
"the runtime list is `user`, the mechanism materializes **exactly one** "
"assistant turn:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"role: assistant\n"
"name: fridge_context\n"
"content: |\n"
"  Below are cross-turn sticky notes you wrote for yourself…\n"
"  ## Fridge magnets\n"
"  (fridge-magnet block with session:id entries)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:31
msgid ""
"This is the **standard form** of fridge magnets in consciousness — not a "
"generic “injection transport” into user or system roles."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:32
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Triggered"
msgid "Trigger rules"
msgstr "已触发"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:37
msgid ""
"**Manifest**: last message is `user`, Redis has ≥1 magnet with non-"
"whitespace `value`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:37
msgid ""
"**Do not manifest**: last message is `assistant`, `tool`, `system`, etc. "
"(tool-loop middle turns have no board)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:37
msgid "**Empty board**: no manifest message; no placeholder"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:39
msgid ""
"Each `beforeLlmCall` pass strips any prior `fridge_context` assistant from "
"the runtime copy, then re-manifests if rules allow."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why not user or system?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:44
msgid ""
"Prepending to **user** text caused the model to attribute notes to the human "
"partner."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:44
msgid ""
"Appending to **system** would invalidate prefix cache for stable self-layer "
"content; the board also changes frequently."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:46
msgid ""
"`assistant(name=fridge_context)` keeps the stable system prefix cacheable, "
"places notes near the current user turn, and signals “self working memory” "
"rather than partner speech."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:47
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Schema Migrations"
msgid "Legacy migration"
msgstr "Schema 迁移"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/fridge-magnet.md:50
msgid ""
"Older builds prepended a fridge-magnet-tagged fenced block inside user "
"message bodies. Runtime still strips those blocks from user content; new "
"manifests use the assistant form only."
msgstr ""

